# Sorted alphabetically (C locale). Negation rules must stay at the bottom so they override earlier patterns.
#
# Secrets: .env holds CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN; backend.hcl holds backend credentials if you use one; *.tfvars hold account IDs and Logpush settings; state can contain
# secrets; *.key / *.pem cover Origin CA certificates and keys; .cloudflared/ holds Tunnel credentials;
# .dev.vars holds Workers local secrets (if you add a Worker, e.g. for CORS preflights).

